{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-and-conditioner-set-sold-via-amazon-2510-0132","content_id":"d61ddbb1-f45b-4375-ac15-0309be752421","description":"Product Safety Report for Pilgrim Anti-Dandruff Shampoo and Conditioner Set presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ce124953-8ca9-4c9a-ae2b-8537f838cb72","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-27T12:43:02+00:00","id":"ce124953-8ca9-4c9a-ae2b-8537f838cb72","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:43:02+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6978b2d6128d9c1d09a98bf5/2510-0132_-product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-conditioner.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Pilgrim Anti-Dandruff Shampoo and Conditioner Set sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as the ingredients list indicates it contains Zinc Pyrithione, which is prohibited for use in cosmetic products</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.  The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming – Hair – Shampoo/Conditioner</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Pilgrim</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Conditioner Identifiers</td>\n      <td>HS5130 Jul 2025 395.00 1.98</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASINs</td>\n      <td>B0D5DBM7G7 (shampoo), B0D5D9BF3Q (conditioner)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Shampoo and conditioner set.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ce124953-8ca9-4c9a-ae2b-8537f838cb72\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6978b2d6128d9c1d09a98bf5/2510-0132_-product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-conditioner.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as the ingredients list indicates it contains Zinc Pyrithione, which is prohibited for use in cosmetic products. It also includes the following undeclared allergens: hydroxycitronellal, hexyl cinnamal, and limonene. This could lead to consumers with sensitivities using these products and having an allergic reaction.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009 on Cosmetic Products.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border. The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2510-0132</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-27T12:45:27Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-27","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-27T12:45:27+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-and-conditioner-set-sold-via-amazon-2510-0132","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-and-conditioner-set-sold-via-amazon-2510-0132","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-and-conditioner-set-sold-via-amazon-2510-0132","content_id":"d61ddbb1-f45b-4375-ac15-0309be752421","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:45:27Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Pilgrim Anti-Dandruff Shampoo and Conditioner Set sold via Amazon (2510-0132) ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-pilgrim-anti-dandruff-shampoo-and-conditioner-set-sold-via-amazon-2510-0132","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"produc